<h1><strong>No Time to Wait!</strong> *</h1>

<h2>The No Time to Wait Conference at the <a href="https://www.sls.fi/nttw11">Society of Swedish Literature in Finland (SLS)</a> in Helsinki</h2>

<p>We are delighted to welcome you to the eleventh edition of »No Time to Wait«, taking place from October 6 to 8, 2027, in Helsinki, Finland!</p>

<p>»No Time to Wait« is a three-day conference dedicated to exploring open media, open standards, and digital audiovisual preservation. Organized by the <a href="https://www.sls.fi/nttw11">Society of Swedish Literature in Finland (SLS)</a> and <a href="https://mediaarea.net/">MediaArea.net</a>, the event marks the eleventh installment of the conference series since its inception in 2016.</p>

